@startuml
!include style.puml
title SD01a — F01 fusion and F02 blueprint generation
actor Organizer as U
boundary "IdeasPanel / BlueprintsPanel\nor EventPlanningCLI" as V
control EventPlanningController as C
control EventPlanningFacade as F
participant EventService as S
participant EventPlanningAgent as A
participant "strategy: PlanningStrategy" as P
participant "repository: PlanRepository" as R
U -> V : Add attributed ideas, then fuse
V -> C : addIdea(eventId, organizer, idea)
C -> F : addIdea(eventId, organizer, idea)
F -> S : addIdea(eventId, organizer, idea)
ref over F,R : SD07 mutation capture/save; applied to each meaningful mutation
V -> C : fuseIdeas(eventId)
C -> F : fuseIdeas(eventId)
F -> S : requireEvent(eventId)
S --> F : Event
F -> A : synthesizeIdeas(event)
ref over A : SD08 AIModel.generate, parse/schema checks, bounded retry
A --> F : List<EventConcept>
F -> S : storeConcepts(eventId, concepts)
F -> R : save(captured PlanData) [state changed]
F --> C : concepts
C --> V : concepts
U -> V : Choose concept and planning priority
V -> C : generateBlueprints(eventId, conceptId, priority)
C -> F : generateBlueprints(eventId, conceptId, priority)
F -> S : requireEvent(eventId)
F -> S : getConcept(eventId, conceptId)
F -> F : PlanningStrategy.fromName(priority)
F -> A : setPlanningStrategy(strategy)
F -> A : generateBlueprints(event, concept)
A -> P : name()
A -> P : buildGuidance(event)
ref over A : SD08 generation; structured/numeric checks before return
A --> F : List<EventBlueprint>
F -> S : storeBlueprints(eventId, blueprints)
F -> R : save(captured PlanData) [state changed]
F --> C : alternatives
C --> V : alternatives for inspection
note over F,A
  F02 does not execute a Places search.
  Validation failure returns an error; no generated results are stored.
  Selection and approval are separate operations: SD01b.
end note
@enduml
